    "Failure typed recovery is not added: a failed token view does not become ready; its borrow must be released before common control detach. Closing source export and mathematical success remain independent facts.",
    "No multi-segment/managed-island producer, sustained finite-slot rotation, complete model quality/throughput claim, driver/native-fault injection, GPU spin kernel or download.",
    "Original caller-owned Graph metadata allocator and external pool root lifetime contracts remain. Detach does not wait for pending work but ordinary final allocator/provider destruction can synchronize; it is not an unconditional nonblocking API."
